--TEST--
a declaration is where a jump lands rather than where one starts, so the cursor on a class's own name answers `none`, `rule:ide/the-index-answers-the-cursor`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Us<|>er
{
    public string $name = "";
}

var $u = new User();
echo $u->name;
--REQUEST--
definition
--EXPECT--
none
